essed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 533.3;"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span><div class="max-w-[85%]"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rs-index="33" data-index="33" data-testid="transcript-row" data-perf-row="assistant" data-perf-row-from-tail="8" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative;"><div role="article" tabindex="-1" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="42" aria-posinset="34" aria-label="Mensagem 34 de 42"><div data-test-render-count="1"><div class="group group/message-row"><div class="contents"><div data-is-streaming="false" class="group relative relative pb-[var(--msg-assistant-pb,0.75rem)]"><h2 data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none" aria-hidden="true">Claude respondeu: Analisei as 7 imagens e elas se encaixam perfeitamente em pontos específicos do seu conteúdo.</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pl-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pr-[var(--msg-inset-end,0.5rem)]"><div><div class="grid grid-rows-[auto_auto] min-w-0"><div class="row-start-1 col-start-1 min-w-0"><div data-find-omitted="" class="contents"><div class="min-w-0 pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] py-[var(--msg-pill-py,0.375rem)]"><div class="flex items-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true"><button type="button" data-testid="tool-status-pill" class="group/status flex flex-1 min-w-0 items-center gap-2 py-1 text-sm text-left transition-colors cursor-pointer text-text-500 hover:text-text-300" aria-expanded="false"><div data-testid="tool-status-spark" class="relative h-5 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 overflow-hidden w-0 -mr-2"><div class="pt-1 motion-reduce:transition-none opacity-0"></div></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 min-w-0"><span class="inline-grid min-w-0"><span class="timeline-status-layer"><span class="truncate font-base">Pensou por 55s</span></span></span><span data-testid="tool-status-caret" class="inline-flex shrink-0 opacity-0 transition-all duration-200 group-hover/status:opacity-100 group-focus-visible/status:opacity-100 -rotate-90"><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 577.8;"></span></span></span></button></div><span class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite">Pensou por 55s</span><div data-closed="" data-cds="Collapsible" aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div></div><div class="row-start-2 col-start-1 relative grid grid-rows-[auto_auto] isolate min-w-0" aria-hidden="true"><div class="row-start-1 col-start-1 relative z-[2] min-w-0"><div><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice));"><div class="_blocks_fp3b6_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block standard-markdown"><p dir="ltr">Analisei as 7 imagens e elas se encaixam perfeitamente em pontos específicos do seu conteúdo. Aqui está a interpretação e o mapeamento:</p>
<h3 dir="ltr">Interpretação de cada imagem</h3>
<div dir="ltr" class="md-table-scroll prose-scroll print:overflow-x-visible"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Imagem</th><th scope="col">O que mostra</th><th scope="col">Onde encaixa</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>7</strong></td><td><code>main</code> aponta pra C1, <code>HEAD</code> (cinza, destacado) aponta separadamente pra C2</td><td>Seção <strong>Commit</strong>, bullet "CUIDADO COM HEAD"</td></tr><tr><td><strong>6</strong></td><td>C0→C1→C2, só <code>main*</code> avançando linearmente</td><td>Seção <strong>Commit</strong>, ilustrando o comando básico <code>git commit</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>3</strong></td><td>C0→C1, com <code>main*</code> e <code>newImage</code> apontando para o mesmo commit C1</td><td>Seção <strong>Branch</strong>, ilustrando <code>git branch [nome]</code> (nova referência criada no mesmo ponto)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>4</strong></td><td>C0→C1→C2, <code>newImage</code> parado em C1, <code>main*</code> avançou pra C2</td><td>Seção <strong>Checkout</strong>, mostrando o efeito de commitar com <code>main</code> ativa</td></tr><tr><td><strong>5</strong></td><td>C0→C1→C2, <code>main</code> parado em C1, <code>newImage*</code> avançou pra C2</td><td>Seção <strong>Checkout</strong>, mostrando o efeito de commitar com <code>newImage</code> ativa (o par da imagem 4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2</strong></td><td>C0→C1, divergindo em <code>bugFix</code>(C2) e <code>main*</code>(C3) — ainda não uniu</td><td>Seção <strong>Merge</strong>, estado <em>antes</em> do merge (no "PARA REPRODUZIR")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1</strong></td><td>C0→C1→C2/C3→C4, com <code>main</code> e <code>bugFix*</code> juntos em C4</td><td>Seção <strong>Merge</strong>, estado <em>depois</em> do merge (resultado do "PARA REPRODUZIR")</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p dir="ltr">Nenhuma imagem corresponde à seção <strong>Rebase</strong> — pode deixar esse commit só com texto.</p>
<hr>
<h3 dir="ltr">Como colocar a imagem ao lado do texto (não no meio)</h3>
<p dir="ltr">Markdown puro não posiciona lado a lado — mas o GitHub aceita a tag HTML <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> com <code>align="right"</code>, que "flutua" a imagem à direita enquanto o texto normal continua fluindo ao redor dela.</p>
<h4 dir="ltr">Passo prévio: subir as imagens para o repositório</h4>
<p dir="ltr">Antes de colar o texto de cada commit:</p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li>Na branch ativa (<code>git-comandos</code> ou <code>github-fluxo-de-colaboracao</code>), vá em <strong>Add file → Upload files</strong></li>
<li>Arraste a imagem correspondente (renomeie antes para algo identificável, ex: <code>head-detached.png</code>)</li>
<li>Coloque-a numa pasta, ex: <code>assets/head-detached.png</code></li>
<li>Escreva a commit message (pode ser a mesma do commit de texto seguinte, ex: <code>docs: adiciona anotações sobre commit</code>) e confirme</li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr">Repita isso para cada imagem, ou suba todas de uma vez numa única tela de upload (o GitHub permite arrastar várias e commitar juntas).</p>
<h4 dir="ltr">Sintaxe para inserir ao lado do texto</h4>
<div data-not-prose=""><div role="group" aria-label="Código markdown" tabindex="0" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 group-hover/copy:backdrop-blur-md group-focus-within/copy:backdrop-blur-md" aria-label="Copiar para a área de transferência" id="_r_2ht_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 433.3;"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div><div class="text-text-500 font-small p-3.5 pb-0">markdown</div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><pre class="code-block__code !my-0 !rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] !text-sm !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code class="language-markdown" data-highlight="final" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre;"><span class="block [unicode-bidi:inherit] [text-align:-webkit-match-parent] [text-align:match-parent]" data-code-line-group=""><span>&lt;img src="assets/head-detached.png" align="right" width="280"&gt;
</span><span>
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span> <span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span>comando <span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">`</span>git commit<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">`</span>:<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span> cria um commit
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span> <span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span>CUIDADO COM HEAD:<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span> indica a posição do main</span></span></code></pre></div></div></div>
<p dir="ltr">A imagem fica alinhada à direita, e o texto/lista continua normalmente à esquerda dela.</p>
<hr>
<h3 dir="ltr">Aplicando aos seus commits</h3>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>Commit 1 — Commit</strong> (arquivo <code>git-comandos.md</code>)</p>
<div data-not-prose=""><div role="group" aria-label="Código markdown" tabindex="0" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 group-hover/copy:backdrop-blur-md group-focus-within/copy:backdrop-blur-md" aria-label="Copiar para a área de transferência" id="_r_2i0_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span