ir="ltr">reescreva a decisão final do que conversamos aqui passo a passo. agora, irei copiar cada passo e texto (com aformatcao ideal das fotos = esquemas) no github.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-deferred="" data-size="xs" class="flex items-center select-none"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-control w-px"></span><button type="button" class="sr-only" aria-label="Mostrar ações da mensagem para Você disse: reescreva a decisão final do que conversamos aqui passo a passo."></button></div></div><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span><div class="max-w-[85%]"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rs-index="35" data-index="35" data-testid="transcript-row" data-perf-row="assistant" data-perf-row-from-tail="6" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative;" aria-hidden="true"><div role="article" tabindex="-1" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="42" aria-posinset="36" aria-label="Mensagem 36 de 42"><div data-test-render-count="1"><div class="group group/message-row"><div class="contents"><div data-is-streaming="false" class="group relative relative pb-[var(--msg-assistant-pb,0.75rem)]"><h2 data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">Claude respondeu: Aqui está o passo a passo final e completo, já incorporando as imagens nos respectivos commits.</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pl-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pr-[var(--msg-inset-end,0.5rem)]"><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice));"><div class="_blocks_fp3b6_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block standard-markdown"><p dir="ltr">Aqui está o passo a passo final e completo, já incorporando as imagens nos respectivos commits.</p>
<hr>
<h2 dir="ltr">PASSO A PASSO FINAL</h2>
<h3 dir="ltr">Preparação</h3>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>1.</strong> Acesse o repositório → seletor de branches → selecione <code>leticia-lafeta-naves</code></p>
<hr>
<h3 dir="ltr">ETAPA 1 — Sub-branch <code>git-comandos</code></h3>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>2.</strong> Crie a sub-branch<br>
Seletor de branches → digite <code>git-comandos</code> → <strong>"Create branch: git-comandos from 'leticia-lafeta-naves'"</strong></p>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>3.</strong> Suba as imagens desta etapa<br>
<strong>Add file → Upload files</strong> → suba, dentro de uma pasta <code>assets/</code>:</p>
<ul dir="ltr">
<li><code>assets/head-detached.png</code> (Imagem 7)</li>
<li>`assets/commit-lin</li>
</ul></div></div><div class="pl-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)] mt-2"><div data-cds="Banner" data-icon-layout="first-line" data-cta-layout="inline" role="status" class="flex items-start gap-xs py-md font-sans text-body px-lg rounded-card bg-surface-1 text-primary shadow-card-ring w-full"><span class="flex min-h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center text-secondary"><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 433.3;"></span></span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-wrap items-start gap-y-sm gap-x-md flex-1"><div class="max-w-full min-w-0 flex-auto">A resposta do Claude foi interrompida.</div><span data-step="3" class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-xs h-[1lh] -ml-[2px] -mr-[calc(var(--cds-pad-md)-2px)]"><div id="_r_2li_" data-trigger-disabled=""><button type="button" data-cds="Button" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus px-md"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-fill-secondary group-hover/btn:bg-fill-secondary-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-secondary-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent shadow-field group-aria-pressed/btn:shadow-field-pressed group-focus-visible/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)]"></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 ">Editar prompt</span></button></div><div id="_r_2ll_" data-trigger-disabled=""><button type="button" data-cds="Button" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus px-md"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-fill-secondary group-hover/btn:bg-fill-secondary-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-secondary-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent shadow-field group-aria-pressed/btn:shadow-field-pressed group-focus-visible/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)]"></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 ">Tentar novamente</span></button></div></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-deferred="" data-size="xs" class="flex items-center select-none ml-[calc(var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)_-_0.375rem)] -mt-1"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-control w-px"></span><button type="button" class="sr-only" aria-label="Mostrar ações da mensagem para Claude respondeu: Aqui está o passo a passo final e completo, já incorporando as imagens nos respectivos commits."></button></div></div></div></div></div><button type="button" class="sr-only select-none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">Carregar mensagens posteriores</button><div aria-hidden="true" data-testid="transcript-spacer" style="height: 7440.61px;"></div><div data-rs-index="39" data-index="39" data-testid="transcript-row" data-perf-row="assistant" data-perf-row-from-tail="2" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative;" aria-hidden="true"><div role="article" tabindex="-1" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="42" aria-posinset="40" aria-label="Mensagem 40 de 42"><div data-test-render-count="1"><div class="group group/message-row"><div class="contents"><div class="group relative relative pb-[var(--msg-assistant-pb,0.75rem)]" style="" data-is-streaming="false"><h2 data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">Claude respondeu: Sim, exatamente.</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pl-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pr-[var(--msg-inset-end,0.5rem)]"><div class=""><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice));"><div class="_blocks_fp3b6_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block standard-markdown"><p dir="ltr">Sim, exatamente. Quando você cria a sub-branch <code>git-comandos</code> e faz o checkout/seleção dela (passo 2 do fluxo), o seletor de branches (aquele ícone no canto superior esquerdo da lista de arquivos) vai passar a mostrar <code>git-comandos</code> no lugar de <code>leticia-lafeta-naves</code>.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr">Por que isso acontece</h3>
<p dir="ltr">Só existe <strong>uma branch ativa por vez</strong> na tela. O seletor sempre mostra o nome de onde você está navegando <em>naquele momento</em>. Então:</p>
<div dir="ltr" class="md-table-scroll prose-scroll print:overflow-x-visible"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col" style="">Você está em...</th><th scope="col" style="">O seletor mostra</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>leticia-lafeta-naves</code></td><td><code>leticia-lafeta-naves</code></td></tr><tr><td>Depois de criar/entrar em <code>git-comandos</code></td><td><code>git-comandos</code></td></tr><tr><td>Depois do merge, ao voltar para <code>leticia-lafeta-naves</code></td><td><code>leticia-lafeta-naves</code> novamente</td></tr><tr><td>Depois de criar/entrar em <code>github-fluxo-de-colaboracao</code></td><td><code>github-fluxo-de-colaboracao</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h3 dir="ltr">Ponto de atenção prático</h3>
<p dir="ltr">Enquanto o seletor mostrar <code>git-comandos</code>, <strong>todo o upload de imagens e todos os commits de texto</strong> dos passos 3 a 8 devem ser feitos com essa branch selecionada (é por isso que cada commit no passo a passo pede pra marcar <strong>"Commit directly to the git-comandos branch"</strong> — essa opção só aparece porque você já está posicionada nela).</p>
<p dir="ltr">Depois do merge (passo 10) e delete (passo 11), você <strong>precisa voltar manualmente</strong> para <code>leticia-lafeta-naves</code> no seletor antes de iniciar a Etapa 2 — senão, ao criar <code>github-fluxo-de-colaboracao</code>, ela nasceria a partir de onde você estivesse (por exemplo, ainda de dentro de <code>git-comandos</code>, que nem existe mais após o delete, o que geraria erro ou confusão).</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" role="toolbar" aria-label="Ações da mensagem" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary ml-[calc(var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)_-_0.375rem)] -mt-1"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0" aria-label="Copiar" data-testid="action-bar-copy" id="_r_1vn_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent gro